{"stem": "block_lfo", "name": "block_lfo", "description": "Block LFO \u2014 block-rate low-frequency oscillator with sample-accurate retrigger.\n\nAccumulates a phase variable one sample at a time using a per-sample loop,\nadvancing by 2\u03c0\u00b7frequency/sample_rate each sample.  When `retrigger` fires\nthe phase is reset to the `phase` parameter value at the exact sample offset\nof the event.  At the end of each block the accumulated phase is used to\ncompute one LFO sample, which is scaled by `amplitude` and published as a\npatchable control output.\n\nParameters:\n  frequency  [0.001, 100] Hz \u2014 LFO rate (default 1 Hz)\n  phase      [0, 2\u03c0]         \u2014 phase offset applied on retrigger (default 0)\n  amplitude  [0, 1]          \u2014 output scale (default 1.0)\n  shape      enum            \u2014 waveform: 0=sin, 1=saw, 2=tri, 3=square\n                              (default 0 = sin)\n\nEvents:\n  retrigger (void) \u2014 resets the phase accumulator to `phase` at the\n                     event's sample offset\n\nControl output:\n  value \u2014 LFO value in [-amplitude, +amplitude], updated every block\n\nWaveform definitions (phase \u03c6 \u2208 [0, 2\u03c0)):\n  sin:    sin(\u03c6)                            \u2208 [-1, 1]\n  saw:    \u03c6/\u03c0 \u2212 1                           \u2208 [-1, 1)\n  tri:    1 \u2212 2\u00b7|\u03c6/\u03c0 \u2212 1|                  \u2208 [-1, 1]\n  square: 1 if \u03c6 < \u03c0, \u22121 otherwise          \u2208 {-1, +1}", "sr": 48000, "ch": 1, "build_meta": {"gen_datetime": "2026-06-29 23:23 UTC", "git_commit": "13f076d", "compiled_with": "9165bcc"}, "wasm": "block_lfo.wasm", "meta_file": "block_lfo.wasm.cragmeta", "meta": {"schema_version": 1, "sample_rate": 48000, "channels": 1, "parameters": [{"name": "frequency", "type": "float", "min": 0.001, "max": 100.0, "default": 1.0, "unit": "hz", "float_index": 0}, {"name": "phase", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 6.283185, "default": 0.0, "float_index": 1}, {"name": "amplitude", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "default": 1.0, "float_index": 2}, {"name": "shape", "type": "enum", "values": ["sin", "saw", "tri", "square"], "default": 0, "int_index": 0}], "samplers": [], "texture_samplers": [], "events": [{"name": "retrigger", "type": "void", "void_index": 0}], "meters": [{"name": "Output", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "float_index": 0}], "param_outputs": [{"name": "value", "type": "float", "out_index": 0}], "has_visualizer": true, "has_audio_output": false, "viz_width": 512, "viz_height": 256, "compiled_with": "9165bcc"}, "mca": {"graph": "block_lfo", "block_size": 512, "results": [{"label": "Intel Haswell (x86-64-v3)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "haswell", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.2156, "block_rthroughput": 102.5, "cycles_per_sample": 0.2002, "insns_per_block": 268, "uops_per_block": 410}, {"label": "Intel Skylake-AVX512 (x86-64-v4)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "skylake-avx512", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.4328, "block_rthroughput": 68.67, "cycles_per_sample": 0.1341, "insns_per_block": 275, "uops_per_block": 412}, {"label": "AMD Zen 3 (znver3)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "znver3", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.9866, "block_rthroughput": 48.0, "cycles_per_sample": 0.0938, "insns_per_block": 267, "uops_per_block": 270}]}, "spectrograms": [], "svg_bundle": {"graphs": {"<top>": {"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 323 178\" width=\"323\" height=\"178\">\n<defs><marker id=\"fwd_audio\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,7 L7,3.5 Z\" fill=\"#c9bb9c\"/></marker><marker id=\"fwd_texture\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L0,7 L7,3.5 Z\" fill=\"#bd8a23\"/></marker><marker id=\"fwd_scalar\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L